    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math isn’t my favorite, but I don’t hate it completely. It’s one of those subjects that feels like a puzzle—some parts click, others just don’t. I get frustrated when things don’t make sense, but I respect how structured it is. Chemistry is more my speed, honestly. Still, I know it’s important, so I try to keep up in class.",
